## Note on Linux / Ubuntu

The **Linux kernel** is **GPLv2-only**. Ubuntu and other distros package that
ecosystem. FSOT Reality OS uses them only as **reference pathways** (study how a
full OS is structured). **We do not ship Linux source as Reality OS**; we build
our own kernel through FSOT under **MIT OR Apache-2.0**.

Studying Linux does not place this repository under GPLv2. Only redistributing
GPL-derived code would require a separate GPL-licensed component and notice.
